Serves the device control API over the Model Context Protocol, on standard input and output or over HTTP

Usage: leptoskit mcp <COMMAND>

Commands:
  serve  Serves MCP on standard input and output, as clients launch it
  http   Serves MCP over HTTP POST on loopback, for direct JSON calls
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
